version: 1.0.0
description: Rust entry point and native plugin registration
components:
  tauri-core:
    description: 'Tauri entry point. Registers opener/dialog/notification plugins; enables the asset protocol; desktop-only menu-bar tray with hide-on-close scoped to the main window. Commands: schedule_wake/cancel_wake (pmset wake-from-sleep) and open_video (dedicated looping YouTube window via an injected initialization script).'
    type: core
    file: src-tauri/src/lib.rs
